  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Society Fund/Uganda AIDS Commission 2010-14</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Civil Society Fund/Uganda AIDS Commission 2010-14</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CSF &#xe4;r en gemensam givarkorg d&#xe4;r medel anv&#xe4;nds till att genomf&#xf6;ra     Ugandas nationella HIV/AIDS-plan 2007/08-2011/12. Fonden distribuerar medel till frivilligorganisationer som i samarbete med nationella och lokala myndigheter genomf&#xf6;r arbete f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka service inom        HIV/AIDS, TB och malaria.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The CSF is a joint donor basket fund in support of the National       HIV/AIDS Strategic plan 2007/2008-2011/2012. The purpose of the fund  is to bring together multiple donor funds and to disperse grants to   civil society that are aligned with national and district plans and   decision making processes and enable an effective, scaled up and      comprehensive response to HIV/AIDS, TB and malaria.</narrative>
  </description>
